{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:11761","original":"An [[official_alternate_costume|official]] derivative of [[Hatsune Miku]] with an [[alternate color]], done with a [[pink theme]]; created to represent the arrival of [[spring (season)|]].\r\n\r\nShe has [[pink hair]] stylized in [[twintails]]. She wears [[cherry hair ornament]]s, a [[sleeveless shirt|sleeveless]] [[white shirt|white]] [[collared shirt]], [[detached sleeves|detached]] [[pink sleeves]], a [[pink necktie]], [[pink skirt|pink]] [[pleated skirt]], and [[pink footwear|pink]] [[thigh boots]] with [[high heel boots|high heels]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #6149346\r\n* !post #6214750: [[sakura miku (rella)|Rella]] [br] Cherry Blossom-Viewing Coordination Ver. by [[Rella]]\r\n* !post #1745036: [[Chuko Miku]] [br] By [[Imoko (imonatsuki)|]]\r\n* !post #8080585: [[Sakura Miku (Noodle Stopper)|Noodle Stopper]] (2022)\r\n* !post #7666192: [[Sakura Miku (Noodle Stopper)|Noodle Stopper]] (2023)\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Aki Miku]] (autumn)\r\n* [[Yuki Miku]] (winter)\r\n* [[Sakura Kaito]]\r\n* [[Sakura Meiko]]\r\n* [[Sakura Mikuo]]\r\n* [[Sakura Luka]]\r\n* [[Sakura Len]]\r\n* [[Sakura Rin]]\r\n* [[Sakura Gumi]]\r\n* [[Sakura SeeU]]\r\n* [[Sakura Teto]]\r\n* [[List of Vocaloid derivatives]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"sakura_miku"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:543959","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f",